---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import business from "@/data/business";
import site from "@/config/site";

const lang = "en";
const canonicalUrl = `${site.url}/en/vip/`;
const alternateUrl = `${site.url}/es/vip/`;
---

<BaseLayout
  title={`Membership Plans | ${business.name}`}
  description="Roadside assistance and preventive maintenance membership plans for commercial trucks and reefer units in Dallas-Fort Worth."
  lang={lang}
  canonicalUrl={canonicalUrl}
  alternateUrl={alternateUrl}
>
  <main class="min-h-screen bg-slate-900 text-white py-16 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto text-center mb-12">
      <span class="inline-block px-4 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold tracking-widest bg-blue-600 text-white uppercase mb-4">
        {business.name}
      </span>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white mb-4">
        MEMBERSHIP PLANS
      </h1>
    </div>

    <!-- Promotional Blocks -->
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-16">
      <div class="bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 rounded-xl p-6">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-blue-400 mb-2">Priority in emergency assistance</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Members receive priority in the coordination and dispatch of their roadside assistance calls, subject to service availability.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 rounded-xl p-6">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-blue-400 mb-2">Roadside assistance services</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Access to special benefits and conditions on selected mobile roadside assistance services, according to the contracted plan.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 rounded-xl p-6">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-blue-400 mb-2">Exclusive mobile assistance discounts</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Enjoy special labor discounts on eligible mobile roadside assistance services, pursuant to your membership terms.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Membership Plans Grid -->
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8 items-stretch mb-16">
      
      <!-- 1. GY Basic -->
      <div class="bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 rounded-2xl p-7 flex flex-col justify-between shadow-xl">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-2">1. GY Basic</h2>
          <div class="flex items-baseline mb-1">
            <span class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-white">Price: $99</span>
            <span class="text-slate-400 text-sm ml-2">/ month</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-amber-400 mb-6 font-semibold">*Annual 12-month service contract</p>

          <div class="mb-6">
            <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-blue-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Included services per year:</h4>
            <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-slate-300 text-sm">
              <li class="flex items-start">
                <span class="text-blue-400 font-bold mr-2">•</span>
                <span>Two engine oil and filter services per year.</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start">
                <span class="text-blue-400 font-bold mr-2">•</span>
                <span>One brake replacement per vehicle axle per year (across all 3 axles).</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start">
                <span class="text-blue-400 font-bold mr-2">•</span>
                <span>One tire replacement per vehicle axle per year (across all 3 axles).</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start">
                <span class="text-blue-400 font-bold mr-2">•</span>
                <span>One reefer unit cleaning per year (mechanical unit only; does not include cargo box).</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start">
                <span class="text-blue-400 font-bold mr-2">•</span>
                <span>One general reefer maintenance per year, with a 10% discount on the total cost.</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="border-t border-slate-700 pt-4 mb-6">
            <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Discounts and benefits:</h4>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-slate-300 text-xs">
              <li>• 10% discount on the total cost of services included in the membership.</li>
              <li>• 10% discount on travel mileage to the member's location.</li>
              <li>• 5% discount on labor for roadside assistance services not included in the membership.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <a
          href={`tel:${business.phone}`}
          class="w-full text-center bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-bold py-3.5 px-4 rounded-xl transition duration-200 shadow-md block text-sm"
        >
          Call to Enroll in GY Basic
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- 2. GY Plus -->
      <div class="bg-slate-800 border-2 border-blue-500 rounded-2xl p-7 flex flex-col justify-between shadow-2xl relative">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-2">2. GY Plus</h2>
          <div class="flex items-baseline mb-1">
            <span class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-white">Price: $169</span>
            <span class="text-slate-400 text-sm ml-2">/ month</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-amber-400 mb-6 font-semibold">*Annual 12-month service contract</p>

          <div class="mb-6">
            <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-blue-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Included services per year:</h4>
            <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-slate-300 text-sm">
              <li class="flex items-start">
                <span class="text-blue-400 font-bold mr-2">•</span>
                <span>Two engine oil and filter services per year; the second with a 20% discount on the total cost.</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start">
                <span class="text-blue-400 font-bold mr-2">•</span>
                <span>One brake replacement per vehicle axle per year (across all 3 axles).</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start">
                <span class="text-blue-400 font-bold mr-2">•</span>
                <span>One tire replacement per vehicle axle per year (across all 3 axles).</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start">
                <span class="text-blue-400 font-bold mr-2">•</span>
                <span>One reefer unit cleaning per year (mechanical unit only; does not include cargo box).</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start">
                <span class="text-blue-400 font-bold mr-2">•</span>
                <span>One reefer unit inspection per year, at no additional charge.</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start">
                <span class="text-blue-400 font-bold mr-2">•</span>
                <span>One general reefer maintenance per year, with a 20% discount on the total cost.</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="border-t border-slate-700 pt-4 mb-6">
            <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Discounts and benefits:</h4>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-slate-300 text-xs">
              <li>• 15% discount on the total cost of services included in the membership.</li>
              <li>• 20% discount on travel mileage to the member's location.</li>
              <li>• 10% discount on labor for roadside assistance services not included in the membership.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <a
          href={`tel:${business.phone}`}
          class="w-full text-center bg-blue-500 hover:bg-blue-600 text-white font-bold py-3.5 px-4 rounded-xl transition duration-200 shadow-md block text-sm"
        >
          Call to Enroll in GY Plus
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- 3. GY Premium -->
      <div class="bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 rounded-2xl p-7 flex flex-col justify-between shadow-xl">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-2">3. GY Premium</h2>
          <div class="flex items-baseline mb-1">
            <span class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-white">Price: $199</span>
            <span class="text-slate-400 text-sm ml-2">/ month</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-amber-400 mb-6 font-semibold">*Annual 12-month service contract</p>

          <div class="mb-6">
            <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-blue-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Included services per year:</h4>
            <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-slate-300 text-sm">
              <li class="flex items-start">
                <span class="text-blue-400 font-bold mr-2">•</span>
                <span>Two engine oil and filter services per year; the second with a 30% discount on the total cost.</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start">
                <span class="text-blue-400 font-bold mr-2">•</span>
                <span>One brake replacement per vehicle axle per year (across all 3 axles).</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start">
                <span class="text-blue-400 font-bold mr-2">•</span>
                <span>One tire replacement per vehicle axle per year (across all 3 axles).</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start">
                <span class="text-blue-400 font-bold mr-2">•</span>
                <span>Two reefer unit cleanings per year (mechanical unit only; does not include cargo box).</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start">
                <span class="text-blue-400 font-bold mr-2">•</span>
                <span>Two reefer unit inspections per year, at no additional charge.</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start">
                <span class="text-blue-400 font-bold mr-2">•</span>
                <span>One general reefer maintenance per year, with a 25% discount on the total cost.</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="border-t border-slate-700 pt-4 mb-6">
            <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Discounts and benefits:</h4>
            <ul class="space-y-2 text-slate-300 text-xs">
              <li>• 20% discount on the total cost of services included in the membership.</li>
              <li>• 25% discount on travel mileage to the member's location.</li>
              <li>• 15% discount on labor for roadside assistance services not included in the membership.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <a
          href={`tel:${business.phone}`}
          class="w-full text-center bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-bold py-3.5 px-4 rounded-xl transition duration-200 shadow-md block text-sm"
        >
          Call to Enroll in GY Premium
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- 4. General conditions & 5. Reefer Scope -->
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-8 text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
      
      <div class="bg-slate-800/80 border border-slate-700 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-4">
          4. General conditions applicable to all three memberships
        </h3>
        <ul class="space-y-3 list-disc pl-5">
          <li>
            Listed rates correspond to a monthly fee subject to a mandatory twelve (12) consecutive month annual service contract.
          </li>
          <li>
            GY Roadside Solutions LLC will supply the parts, replacement components, oil, filters, tires, brake components, and other necessary materials to perform the services included in the membership, as applicable. The cost of these items will be subject to the discounts established for each service.
          </li>
          <li>
            Inclusion of brake replacements and tire replacements across all three (3) vehicle axles is contingent upon mechanical parts and tires being supplied and purchased directly through GY Roadside Solutions LLC. If the member elects to supply their own parts, materials, or tires, the service will not be complimentary, and the plan discount will apply strictly to standard hourly labor rates.
          </li>
          <li>
            The two annual oil change services must be performed with a minimum interval of three months between them.
          </li>
          <li>
            General maintenance of the refrigerated unit (reefer) may be performed only after five months have elapsed from the client's membership effective start date.
          </li>
          <li>
            GY Roadside Solutions LLC provides no warranty on components or parts supplied by the customer or third parties, and is held harmless from failures or incidents resulting therefrom. Furthermore, the company assumes no liability for loss, spoilage, or damage of transported cargo, loss of business, or highway delays due to traffic conditions or force majeure.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-slate-800/80 border border-slate-700 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-4">
          5. Scope of general refrigerated unit (reefer) maintenance
        </h3>
        <p class="mb-4">
          General reefer maintenance exclusively covers the following work on the mechanical refrigeration unit (does not include the trailer cargo box or internal/external trailer wash-outs):
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-2 list-disc pl-5 mb-4">
          <li>Oil and filter change of the reefer unit.</li>
          <li>Belt replacement.</li>
          <li>Topping off refrigerant levels when necessary (subject to technical inspection pursuant to EPA Section 608 regulations; refrigerant will not be added to systems with unaddressed leaks).</li>
          <li>Operational check of compressor performance and general unit operation.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs leading-relaxed">
          This maintenance does not include repairing refrigerant leaks, major mechanical or electrical repairs, disassembly of major assemblies, replacement of other components, or work outside of what is expressly listed. If a leak, breakdown, or need for additional work is identified, the member will be notified and an estimate provided separately.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
